  preview: Hey, need {item} ASAP, people are already here...
  introduction: Hey, it's urgent. My friends are already here, and we're out of stock.
    I need {amount} of {item} ASAP. I can do {price} for the whole lot. Don't let
    me down.
  acceptTask: 'Just hurry. Send coordinates when you''re done. I''ll be watching
    my phone.

'
  rejectTask: What? Seriously? I got people waiting. You just lost a regular. Whatever,
    I'll find someone else.
  bargainPositive: Fine, whatever! Just hurry up with it. Send location when ready.
  bargainNegative: '{price}? You kidding? I''ll find someone faster. Forget it.'
  dealOverPositive: "Got it. Finally. My guys are happy. Later.\r"
  dealOverNegative: Where the hell are you? I've been waiting for an hour. People
    are leaving. You wasted my whole night. Don't bother contacting me again.
